中、シャンデリアが瓦礫ごと落下。それを主人公の優吾くんが保奈美ちゃんの所に飛び込んで間一髪で守り抜く」という映画のワンシーンのようなシチュエーションでお願いします。\nオリキャラに関しましては自己解釈で描いて構いません。セリフなどはお任せします。", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 300029, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "ちつぷ", "screen_name": "ch1tsupu", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1737475022849974273/QvABltFu.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/780177895566090242/1691883523/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 160}, {"id": 564290, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "ウスイ", "screen_name": "usui_iigame", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/609302879426318337/SwpoGaRF.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/443601922/1434104163/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "novel"}, {"genre": "video"}], "banned": false, "nc": 17}, {"id": 1749747, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "かいそー", "screen_name": "kaisooekaki", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1590911133568749568/-ePfHcQI.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1375042816384983043/1653339498/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_day